58e2e-d393-439e-8b9c-14793c40c100", "type": "concept", "title": "Licensing and availability"}], "description": "Gist: Strong type choice starts from the problem, not from personal taste alone."}, {"id": "e1563e35-b830-465f-b1ce-e54b95534682", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Pairing typefaces", "children": [{"id": "c32fa354-9ac0-44c4-8c81-f9fd9025b129", "type": "concept", "title": "Serif and sans pairing"}, {"id": "272653fe-7477-4c73-8c53-8322dc538a9c", "type": "concept", "title": "Display plus text"}, {"id": "72c892f8-447e-4793-b7a5-4088d7353958", "type": "concept", "title": "Superfamilies"}, {"id": "e5ca4a44-86fa-4b41-b508-cc7da07a5303", "type": "concept", "title": "Avoiding conflict"}], "description": "Gist: Pairing requires contrast, compatibility, and a clear division of labor."}]}, {"id": "837e6ded-efdb-4dca-87bc-d8187d731c00", "type": "topic", "title": "Spacing: Kerning, Tracking, Leading, and Rhythm", "description": "Control the micro-decisions that determine whether type feels careful, readable, and professional.", "children": [{"id": "8b7321b7-5808-498d-bbd3-bbd6d5f53f5d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Kerning and letterspacing", "children": [{"id": "6039e9a2-820e-4cdb-a5d0-d4f9d687549c", "type": "concept", "title": "Problem pairs"}, {"id": "50adc9bb-8bdd-4799-998d-adc3a4fbb06a", "type": "concept", "title": "Optical spacing"}, {"id": "3152f705-629b-4db4-b195-902d0bc52877", "type": "concept", "title": "All caps tracking"}, {"id": "c0bed34a-d47c-4ef4-bc9c-9f6ffed7b77d", "type": "concept", "title": "Display spacing"}], "description": "Gist: Micro-spacing makes words look even and intentional instead of mechanically assembled."}, {"id": "c39c2c24-f185-497e-98bb-e2a58ae5d15d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Leading and line length", "children": [{"id": "e4e53560-277b-44bd-8f2e-14bc01035b37", "type": "concept", "title": "Measure"}, {"id": "de0c3e48-2487-4d25-addb-ac9f8f619ede", "type": "concept", "title": "Line height"}, {"id": "91d680a8-444e-47d5-9488-9604514f7ac1", "type": "concept", "title": "Rag quality"}, {"id": "ef8fef42-708f-4731-a47a-162970d28250", "type": "concept", "title": "Paragraph density"}], "description": "Gist: Line spacing and measure shape reading comfort, pace, and typographic color."}, {"id": "ae693691-fa69-4612-87f0-2b4b61f7ef2d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Rhythm and typographic color", "children": [{"id": "64fb4da5-837c-4e4f-8a20-1fd01c772f36", "type": "concept", "title": "Even texture"}, {"id": "9657c86a-a76e-48a4-b70e-f8ff56da3100", "type": "concept", "title": "White space"}, {"id": "298f8567-c941-4b33-aae7-154d5ceefd99", "type": "concept", "title": "Vertical rhythm"}, {"id": "f8949d68-7e1e-41a5-ba31-60794f26378f", "type": "concept", "title": "Spacing hierarchy"}], "description": "Gist: Spacing creates the overall texture of a page or screen."}]}, {"id": "c2dcde88-b044-4ea3-893c-522e98e93aa9", "type": "topic", "title": "Hierarchy and Information Structure", "description": "Use typographic contrast to guide attention, clarify meaning, and organize complex information.", "children": [{"id": "de4d3d28-3842-4d23-b1ac-a87bda4ea048", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Contrast tools", "children": [{"id": "77c970c9-b19a-4673-818d-2fc4856b980f", "type": "concept", "title": "Size"}, {"id": "6040154b-eeca-469c-b69f-51b32e39870d", "type": "concept", "title": "Weight"}, {"id": "ea80ae49-bd98-47c3-a4ba-2dfefb17790e", "type": "concept", "title": "Color"}, {"id": "f94a2b7d-8601-4bbd-b91e-da8a2986fff9", "type": "concept", "title": "Position and spacing"}], "description": "Gist: Hierarchy is created through controlled differences that tell readers what to see first."}, {"id": "ee24a06c-0c4e-455b-8578-51fb4a69e32f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Information chunking", "children": [{"id": "a4212b0b-7727-4510-92a3-db56ddb062f3", "type": "concept", "title": "Headings"}, {"id": "dba060c4-a047-4b67-8f99-3c0ccc6398fb", "type": "concept", "title": "Subheads"}, {"id": "48cfed3a-a116-48e0-90a3-519b3c93f180", "type": "concept", "title": "Captions"}, {"id": "2fddba5a-06a2-4c54-8c0c-46a02043f355", "type": "concept", "title": "Pull quotes and side notes"}], "description": "Gist: Typography organizes content into scanable units and relationships."}, {"id": "e4161698-ebd1-41bf-a4d1-372b0f767a90", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Reading paths", "children": [{"id": "75b0015f-19d8-43f0-b904-6a98c9a943d9", "type": "concept", "title": "Entry points"}, {"id": "e4d712f2-1550-423a-809a-666a64f91bec", "type": "concept", "title": "Primary and secondary reads"}, {"id": "1038f04b-e577-42ba-ace7-2f3beddaa7e6", "type": "concept", "title": "Emphasis without clutter"}, {"id": "8e806827-ebaa-430f-8e04-f03134999587", "type": "concept", "title": "Sequence"}], "description": "Gist: Good hierarchy creates a deliberate path through information."}]}, {"id": "0d0e02b6-057f-48de-b328-bd2459e537aa", "type": "topic", "title": "Grids, Alignment, and Layout Systems", "description": "Develop page and screen structures that support rhythm, consistency, and visual order.", "children": [{"id": "1e4a2d9f-f53c-4d23-8767-278984935055", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Grid fundamentals", "children": [{"id": "65d63e96-4488-4287-a21b-2a1fe395a12a", "type": "concept", "title": "Margins"}, {"id": "1ef04f6e-b2fa-44da-8473-55709aea2ed2", "type": "concept", "title": "Columns"}, {"id": "3b4cfe6c-4953-4f7c-83a0-ae3d3ae17d00", "type": "concept", "title": "Gutters"}, {"id": "fc9e762e-3910-4fc4-8489-d61519563723", "type": "concept", "title": "Modules"}], "description": "Gist: Grids create a hidden structure that supports consistency, variation, and efficient decision-making."}, {"id": "2a1272ce-87ec-4d5b-9338-50bfca76faad", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Alignment and proximity", "children": [{"id": "3bbebe90-a4be-4e0b-baef-23d0fe13489c", "type": "concept", "title": "Left, centered, and justified alignment"}, {"id": "0e6e06f3-2dbb-46b2-9439-cc913a506a09", "type": "concept", "title": "Optical alignment"}, {"id": "efd4d6ec-ee1e-496b-b39d-2c266bc0faa3"